      "writtenOn": "2024-01-05T01:42:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Let me expand more on this.\nWhen using a prebuilt, the value of the flag is computed when the prebuilt is build. Not when the system image is build.\n\nThe test will be build again the latest flag value, the phone / cloud device will have whatever the value of the prebuilt is.\n\nIf you are ok with that, then it is fine to merge the CL, but just a heads up that there will still be failure in the future",
      "parentUuid": "f6cc7dd8_bf3b697d",
      "revId": "a24423dc7609d6be97de9d5f95ad3633c4ffec18",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "fcb5128d_864159e3",
